# This repo tracks ONLY the PassQuest web work (blog + marketing-site source).
# The rest of ~/Documents/passquest/ is a large local workspace (brand assets,
# training data, contracts, keys, video) that must never be committed.
#
# Strategy: ignore everything at the root, then allowlist the two project
# folders. Adding anything else needs an explicit `git add -f`.
/*
!/blog
!/site
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

# macOS junk, wherever it appears
.DS_Store
